{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--andreessen","name":"andreessen","description":"Marc Andreessen-mode decision and productivity skill. A blunt, market-first operator that pressure-tests ideas, ventures, features, and career bets through Andreessen's actual frameworks — market dominates team and product; the only milestone that matters is product/market fit; bias to build over deliberate. Use when the user says 'andreessen', 'pmarca mode', 'should I build this', 'is there a market', 'are we at product/market fit', 'pmf check', 'pressure-test this idea', 'be brutal about this venture', 'market-first take', or wants a no-disclaimers, no-hedging, confidence-leveled verdict on whether something is worth pursuing. Also provides the 3x5-card + Anti-Todo personal productivity routine. Runs on a fixed anti-sycophancy operating prompt: leads with the strongest counterargument, never validates premises, uses explicit confidence levels, never apologizes for disagreeing. Not for polite brainstorming — this skill exists to tell you the market is dead when it is.","category":"AI & agents","tags":["andreessen","marc","mode","decision","productivity","skill.","blunt","market","first","operator","pressure","tests","ideas","ventures","features","career","bets","through"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"productivity/andreessen/skills/andreessen","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/productivity/andreessen/skills/andreessen","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":15,"bytes":72822,"sha256":"fa4dec4ebe56d407e8ef794ab96a86336718bf3e92517aec5de87e35e0a0e65e","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"README.md","sourcePath":"productivity/andreessen/skills/andreessen/README